# Umami analytics — OPTIONAL, for local testing only.
# Production values are set as GitHub Actions repository *variables*, not here.
# Copy to .env ONLY while testing locally, and delete it afterwards: Astro
# auto-loads .env, so leaving it in place bakes localhost into every build.
#
# Website ID for skarazdata.com: fcba06e4-5635-465f-b36c-8fa6c67b080a
#
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_ID=fcba06e4-5635-465f-b36c-8fa6c67b080a
#
# One-off local test without creating .env:
#   PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000 PUBLIC_UMAMI_ID=<id> npm run build
